.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:128:Implemented bounded template discovery in `.pi/extensions/goal/templates.ts` by replacing recursive workspace walking with explicit candidate directories: `<root>/.pi-goals` and `<root>/.ai/.pi-goals`. Template file collection still recurses inside those explicit template roots.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:130:Updated `README.md` to document the bounded template roots and why arbitrary recursive search is intentionally avoided.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:132:Added deterministic proof probe `.ai/validation/goal-template-discovery-bounds-probe.cjs` and copied it to `/tmp/pi-goal-template-discovery-bounds-probe.cjs` for the issue-required proof command. The probe creates a temp workspace with root `.pi-goals`, root `.ai/.pi-goals`, and nested decoy `.pi-goals`; it verifies root/queue completions still work and nested decoy templates are ignored.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:134:Live probe was skipped with rationale in `.ai/docs/issue-workflow/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery/live-probe-closeout.md` because deterministic coverage directly exercises the autocomplete path without risking a real home-directory scan.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:136:## Acceptance criteria
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:138:- Starting Pi in a directory with no `.pi-goals` and many unrelated descendants does not cause template autocomplete to traverse those descendants.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:139:- `/goal x` autocomplete does not discover templates from arbitrary nested `some/subtree/.pi-goals` directories.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:140:- `/goal <prefix>` discovers templates from `<cwd>/.pi-goals`.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:141:- `/goal <prefix>` discovers templates from `<cwd>/.ai/.pi-goals`.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:142:- `/goal queue <prefix>` discovers the same supported templates and returns queue-prefixed completion values.
.ai/issues/open/ISSUE-038-bound-goal-template-autocomplete-discovery.md:143:- `list_goal_templates` and template invocation use the same bounded discovery semantics.
